   "label": "Monitoring Mode",
   "options": "Off\nSelf-hosted\nGrafana Cloud\nHybrid",
   "default": "Off",
   "description": "Grafana Cloud: Frappe pushes metrics and events to Grafana Cloud. Hybrid: the local Prometheus stack keeps running and forwards everything to Grafana Cloud (use while migrating). Self-hosted: local stack only. Off: results stay in Frappe."
